OPL3 FPGA by Greg Taylor, https://github.com/gtaylormb/opl3_fpga (commit 491a4dc, 2025-09-21)
LGPL-3.0-or-later (COPYING.LESSER); afifo.v is (C) Gisselquist Technology, GPL-3.0.

Changes for ZEMMIX:
- module opl3 renamed to opl3fpga (opl3fpga.sv) and timer to opl3fpga_timer: the
  names clash with misc/opl3/opl3.sv
- opl3_pkg.sv: CLK_FREQ 50e6 (CLOCK_50), CLK_DIV_COUNT 1006 (49.702kHz), 16-bit
  output, timers on, samples synchronized to clk_dac
- opl3fpga_msx.sv: wrapper with the ports of misc/opl3/opl3.sv
